WEBVTT

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:32.226
And now each tree will be planted
in a home, a school,

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:37.788
an office, a public space,
on a hillside or in a mangrove

00:03:37.812 --> 00:03:40.006
by a tree steward.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:44.066
Anyone in Freetown
can opt to be a tree steward.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.986
And the growth of the trees

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:49.576
will be tracked by our
community-based growing teams

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:53.506
using our custom-made Treetracker app.

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:56.646
This isn't just about planting trees,

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.764
it's about growing trees,

00:03:58.788 --> 00:04:01.951
and it's about ensuring
that each one of us